cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Traceweave: a device-independent personal computing substrate"
message: "If you reference this prototype, cite the repository and the commit you used."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Inceptless"
repository-code: "https://github.com/haeliotang/traceweave"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An Android application, Rust core and Python tooling exploring user-sovereign personal
  computing: local rule-based planning, an encrypted memory vault, an append-only audit trail
  anchored in the device Keystore, and experimental device-to-device sync. Prototype software;
  published builds are development-key side loads.
keywords:
  - personal computing
  - agent substrate
  - android
  - rust
